Package: metewand
Title: Worker Helpers for Metewand Benchmarks
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Johan", "Larsson", email = "johan@jolars.co", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Small implementation, dataset materializer, and independent evaluator
    helpers for the version-1 Metewand worker protocol. Provides strict canonical
    JSON, explicit artifact inventories, and callback dispatch over dedicated pipes.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: digest, stats, utils
SystemRequirements: POSIX, C++17 with floating-point std::to_chars
NeedsCompilation: yes
URL: https://github.com/jolars/metewand
